OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy Sunday with rain in south, but
OL,7,Fbrighter later. Staying changeable
OL,8,Finto the new working week. Turning
OL,9,Fquite warm, although tempered by
OL,10,Fspells of rain and the breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
